# Store & Forward, and the half of it that is not configuration.
#
# Filmed rather than described because the shape is the argument: the section opens on what a
# handheld actually wants from the module - who would answer, one press that asks for the
# traffic that arrived while the Brick was off, and what the last press got - and only then on
# the seven rows that configure a server this device will never be.
#
# The result row is the one to watch. "3 new of 18" is two facts, not one: the router replayed
# its whole window and three of those messages were new here. A row saying "18 messages" would
# be reporting the router's work rather than the user's inbox.
scene demo
scale 4
delay 180
config

tab settings
hold 400
# Down to Modules, into it, and down to Store & Forward.
key down 12
hold 500
key a
hold 700
key down 1
hold 500
key a
hold 1400
key down 3
hold 900
key b
hold 500
